57
00:03:00,633 --> 00:03:05,004
In the separate thirty B development run, the base passed six of twenty-four

58
00:03:05,004 --> 00:03:07,754
tasks; the adapter passed twelve.

59
00:03:08,421 --> 00:03:10,854
Those are exploratory development results.

60
00:03:11,115 --> 00:03:15,354
We still need to match the training records, lock the comparison, and test

61
00:03:15,354 --> 00:03:20,075
on untouched tasks. Better quality and fewer human interruptions are still

62
00:03:20,075 --> 00:03:20,842
