63
00:03:21,050 --> 00:03:22,836
Three optional pieces could help.

64
00:03:23,153 --> 00:03:25,805
Nemo Gym would organize repeatable trials.

65
00:03:26,066 --> 00:03:30,252
Jev would turn locked results into advice for John and me to review.

66
00:03:30,722 --> 00:03:34,512
Langfuse would show the sequence of model calls, tools, and checks.

67
00:03:35,179 --> 00:03:38,456
Those connections are proposed; we're not claiming they're running.

68
00:03:39,012 --> 00:03:42,977
We want useful work that passes checks and independent review, with less

69
00:03:42,977 --> 00:03:44,610
